text.en:
While <void/>Void Overshield is active, Glaive Melee attacks deal 20% increased damage.

//Works fully with the Warlock Rift overshield, but entirely nonfunctional with the Class Stat overshield. Only half works with One Eyed Mask's overshield (lmao??), gives the damage boost but no void OS on kill. Just toss it all, only works with Void OS.

Glaive Melee kills grant 100% Glaive Energy, fully refill <void/>Void Overshield Health, and extend Overshield duration to 8 seconds (12 with <void/>Echo of Persistance).
